n internal sequence producer or fail the compression operation. The user can\n2881- * choose between the two behaviors by setting the ZSTD_c_enableSeqProducerFallback\n2882- * cParam. Fallback compression will follow any other cParam settings, such as\n2883- * compression level, the same as in a normal compression operation.\n2884- *\n2885: * The user shall instruct zstd to use a particular ZSTD_sequenceProducer_F\n2886- * function by calling\n2887- *         ZSTD_registerSequenceProducer(cctx,\n2888- *                                       sequenceProducerState,\n2889- *                                       sequenceProducer)\n2890- * This setting will persist until the next parameter reset of the CCtx.\n2891- *\n2892- * The sequenceProducerState must be initialized by the user before calling\n2893- * ZSTD_registerSequenceProducer(). The user is responsible for destroying the\n2894- * sequenceProducerState.\n2895- *\n2896- * *** LIMITATIONS ***\n2897- * This API is compatible with all zstd compression APIs which respect advanced parameters.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b0ef8e1e-2e1d-45e6-be23-c299770ecb9a","uuid":"50037511-3e5e-40d3-a50d-7eddce75bd2d","timestamp":"2026-09-04T05:02:58.366Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"c_src/src/compress/zstd_compress_internal.h:1541:/* ZSTD_getCParamsFromCCtxParams() :\nc_src/src/compress/zstd_compress_internal.h:1546:ZSTD_compressionParameters ZSTD_getCParamsFromCCtxParams(\nc_src/src/compress/zstd_compress.c:1637:ZSTD_compressionParameters ZSTD_getCParamsFromCCtxParams(\n1971:ZSTDLIB_STATIC_API size_t ZSTD_CCtx_setCParams(ZSTD_CCtx* cctx, ZSTD_compressionParameters cparams);\n1977:ZSTDLIB_STATIC_API size_t ZSTD_CCtx_setFParams(ZSTD_CCtx* cctx, ZSTD_frameParameters fparams);\n1983:ZSTDLIB_STATIC_API size_t ZSTD_CCtx_setParams(ZSTD_CCtx* cctx, ZSTD_parameters params);\n2962-  ZSTD_sequenceProducer_F sequenceProducer\n2978-  ZSTD_sequenceProducer_F sequenceProducer\n=== seq producer type ===\n2822- * 